    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "213d5eb2e7233291cce3": "Train me.",
        "5d26701bea1e4910ddd8": "Skin, glorious skin. It holds your insides... in. You might've noticed my skin's not doing so well. To think I used to worry about my pores. Hardly any skin left to worry about these days. In a way, it's very freeing.",
        "c3a3d088c734cc935fd4": "Before the plague came, I knew nothing about leather. Now I know enough to teach others. Death's left me with a lot of time on my hands.",
        "e38386b685f631d23eab": "You've got the hang of it. I can't teach you any more, but talk to Arthur Moore, a Forsaken who works in the Rogues' Quarter of the Undercity. Tell him I sent you."
      },
      "name": "Shelene Rhobart",
      "subName": "Journeyman Leatherworker",
      "translationMetadata": {
        "fields": {
          "dialogue.213d5eb2e7233291cce3": {
